Also for AC1, the PR should land in pr_created lane. PR fixture: `{number: 31, title: 'feat: x', labels: [], head: {ref: 'ai/x', sha: 'abc'}, user: {login: 'me'}, created_at: '2026-10-08T09:00:00Z'}`.

